ing within, or will you succumb to the fears that dwell in the shadows? Prepare for a heart-pounding adventure that tests your courage, survival skills, and bravery in a race against time and terror.", "short_description": "A Multiplayer Experience In Which Players Go Into A Vast Expanse Of Tunnels. But Watch Out Because Something Is Watching You. You Must Survive The Monsters That Lurk In The Shadows."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/7a10cd74-5f3f-4c0a-aaa7-1d753caf0078", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SoopyStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scarymonkers/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9488960981159865"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1911496896152730"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "848973103984218"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1911496896152730"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1773516720, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1911496896152730"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9358430600879571", "version": "2.0"}, "id": "2825799064258550", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oc